                                                "sense_id": "ec8cd883-74e8-3d36-b2b6-329d41ff4b4f",
                                                "text": "Indochinese refugees, known throughout the world as the “boat people,” were subject to horrific suffering and dangers when the Vietnamese government began expelling them after the fall of Saigon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adee6ff1-392d-3744-a84a-9714941da344",
